---
import Layout from "@/layouts/MarkdownLayout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy | GavDaly" description="Privacy information for gavdaly.com.">
  <Fragment slot="header"><h1>Privacy</h1></Fragment>
  <p>
    This is a personal website operated by Gavin Daly. I aim to collect as
    little information as possible. Most pages are static documents and can be
    read without an account, registration, or submission of personal details.
    The site does not sell personal information or use advertising profiles to
    follow visitors around the web.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you use the contact form, the name, email address, message, and the
    information required to prevent automated abuse are processed so I can
    receive and answer the request. Contact-form messages are delivered to my
    notification service and retained only as long as reasonably needed to
    communicate and maintain security records. Please do not include sensitive
    personal information in a message.
  </p>
  <p>
    The hosting provider may process standard request data such as an IP
    address, browser details, timestamps, and diagnostic information to deliver
    the site, protect it from abuse, and keep the service reliable. This site
    may contain links to external services; their privacy practices are
    controlled by those services. For questions about this policy or a contact
    request, use the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
